            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "The same problem happens to `vim.wait()`. Aren't those functions supposed to be synchronous? I don't understand how this works.\n\nBut here is a workaround:\n```lua\nlocal child = MiniTest.new_child_neovim()\nchild.start()\nlocal packs = child.lua_get(\"vim.pack.get()\")\n```",
